              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-frame page\" id=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-zoom\">\n      <div class=\"hero-drop\">\n        <div class=\"kb\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/property/villas-dusk.webp')\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-copy center\">\n      <span class=\"label\">Stay With Us</span>\n      <h1><span class=\"line\"><i>The Rooms</i></span></h1>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- INTRO -->\n<section class=\"intro\">\n  <p class=\"reveal\">Each villa is wrapped in teak and garden light — air-conditioned, quietly luxurious, and made for slow mornings. Three ways to stay, all moments from Canggu and Seminyak.</p>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ROOM 1 — Garden Wooden Villa -->\n<section class=\"wrap split\" id=\"garden-wooden-villa\">\n  <div class=\"media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/garden-villa/bed.webp\" alt=\"One Bedroom Garden Wooden Villa\"></div>\n  <div class=\"body reveal d1\">\n    <span class=\"label\">01 · Garden View</span>\n    <h2>One Bedroom<br>Garden Wooden Villa</h2>\n    <p>A freestanding teak villa wrapped in garden greenery. A king bed beneath a high wooden ceiling and flowing canopy, with an open-air bathtub framed by tropical planting — slow mornings, distilled.</p>\n    <ul class=\"amenities\">\n      <li>King bed</li><li>Garden view</li><li>Open-air bathtub</li>\n      <li>Air conditioning</li><li>Flat-screen TV</li><li>Fast Wi-Fi</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"amt\">Rates on request</span><span class=\"per\">per night</span></div>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://beds24.com/book-natajiwa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Availability</a>\n    <div class=\"thumbs\">\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/garden-villa/garden-view.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/garden-villa/bathroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/garden-villa/bedroom-pool.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ROOM 2 — Deluxe Villa -->\n<section class=\"wrap split rev\" id=\"deluxe-villa\">\n  <div class=\"media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/deluxe-villa/bedroom.webp\" alt=\"One Bedroom Deluxe Villa\"></div>\n  <div class=\"body reveal d1\">\n    <span class=\"label\">02 · Stone Bath</span>\n    <h2>One Bedroom<br>Deluxe Villa</h2>\n    <p>Our most spacious stay — marble floors, a soaring timber ceiling, and a private terrace. Rest under a canopy king bed, then unwind in an indoor stone bathtub with a rain shower and its own leafy open-air corner.</p>\n    <ul class=\"amenities\">\n      <li>King bed</li><li>Private terrace</li><li>Indoor stone bathtub</li>\n      <li>Rain shower</li><li>Air conditioning</li><li>Fast Wi-Fi</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"amt\">Rates on request</span><span class=\"per\">per night</span></div>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://beds24.com/book-natajiwa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Availability</a>\n    <div class=\"thumbs\">\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/deluxe-villa/bathroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/deluxe-villa/terrace.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/deluxe-villa/bathroom-open.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ROOM 3 — Pool Villa -->\n<section class=\"wrap split\" id=\"pool-villa\">\n  <div class=\"media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/pool-villa/pool-view.webp\" alt=\"One Bedroom Pool Villa\"></div>\n  <div class=\"body reveal d1\">\n    <span class=\"label\">03 · Private Pool</span>\n    <h2>One Bedroom<br>Pool Villa</h2>\n    <p>Your own private pool and daybed gazebo, steps from the bedroom. A king bed opens onto the water and garden, and the whole villa turns toward the pool as it catches the afternoon light.</p>\n    <ul class=\"amenities\">\n      <li>King bed</li><li>Private pool</li><li>Poolside daybed</li>\n      <li>Open-air bathtub</li><li>Air conditioning</li><li>Fast Wi-Fi</li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"amt\">Rates on request</span><span class=\"per\">per night</span></div>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://beds24.com/book-natajiwa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Availability</a>\n    <div class=\"thumbs\">\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/pool-villa/pool.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/pool-villa/bedroom-pool.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n      <span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/rooms/pool-villa/bed.webp\" alt=\"\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- BAND -->\n<section class=\"band\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-08.webp')\"></section>\n\n<!-- QUOTE -->\n<section class=\"quote\">\n  <div class=\"reveal\">\n    <span class=\"label\">Slow Living</span>\n    <p>Draw a bath beneath open air, float in the pool at first light, and let the garden do the rest.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CTA OASIS -->\n<section class=\"oasis\" id=\"oasis\">\n  <div class=\"leaf\" style=\"background-image:url('/wp-content/themes/natajiwa-child/assets/img/gallery-09.webp')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\"><h2>Reserve Your<br>Stay at Natajiwa</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"reveal d1\">\n      <p>Tell us your dates and we'll hold the room that fits your stay. Direct booking, warm welcome, and honest island rates.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn light\" href=\"https://beds24.com/book-natajiwa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book Now</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->"
              }
